<span class="tinyicontxt">Throne of Thunder</span></a> items will become available after the raid has released. This list has unlimited <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
