<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="celestial-dungeon-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_legendarygem_05.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Celestial Dungeon Gear for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available from Celestial Dungeons in Phase 3 of Mists of Pandaria Classic. Keep in mind that these items are likely to be replaced by their Normal and Heroic raid counterparts, or even the new <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> items. With that in mind, this is not a true "best in slot" list and should instead serve as a rough guideline for what to keep an eye on from Celestial Dungeons.<br/>
<br/>The Celestial dungeon items that are lower iLvl variants of raid items <i>(formerly obtained from the LFR tool)</i>; the very best <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6622/throne-of-thunder">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Throne of Thunder</span></a> variants of Celestial items will be available after <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6622/throne-of-thunder">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Throne of Thunder</span></a> releases, purchased with the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=3350/august-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="August Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendarygem_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">August Stone Fragment</span></span></a> currency that is acquired running Celestial dungeons.<br/>
<br/>
