<del></del></span> Heroic Dungeon Gear for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Heroic dungeons, although it is very important to remember that because other gear may be obtained at a higher item level from raids, crafting, World Bosses, etc, it is not a true "best in slot" list but more of a rough guideline, and players should sim the gear they actually have available to them in order to determine their best combination of stats and effects. <br/>
<br/>Notably, the best weapon from heroic dungeons, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87542/mogudar-blade-of-the-thousand-slaves">
