<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Retribution Paladin</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria also includes a number of open world mobs and world bosses that also offer the chance to obtain powerful, high level epics. This includes Rare Mobs <i>("silver elites")</i> like <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50350/morgrinn-crackfang">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Morgrinn Crackfang</span></a>, but also World Bosses such as <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">Galleon &amp; Salyis' Warband</a> and the <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>Additionally, there are a number of valuable random world-drop Epics that are Bind on Equip. These can be purchased off the Auction House if you have the gold to spare and aren't lucky enough to have one drop for you.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="oondasta">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_zandalaribabyraptorwhite.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>
<a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69161/oondasta">Oondasta</a> is a new world boss that drops a number of notable 522 ilvl epics:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95192/belt-of-the-tyrannotitan">
<img alt="Belt of the Tyrannotitan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Tyrannotitan</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95199/carnotaur-battlegloves">
<img alt="Carnotaur Battlegloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gloves_plate_deathknight_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Carnotaur Battlegloves</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95180/overcompensating-chain-of-the-alpha-male">
<img alt="Overcompensating Chain of the Alpha Male" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_121.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Overcompensating Chain of the Alpha Male</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95167/ring-of-king-kangrom">
<img alt="Ring of King Kangrom" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_173.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of King Kangrom</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95153/tyrant-king-battleplate">
<img alt="Tyrant King Battleplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tyrant King Battleplate</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95198/vulcanodon-gauntlets">
<img alt="Vulcanodon Gauntlets" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gloves_plate_raidwarrior_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vulcanodon Gauntlets</span></a></div></li></ul>The most notable item here is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95167/ring-of-king-kangrom">
<img alt="Ring of King Kangrom" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_173.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of King Kangrom</span></a> which is one of the two pre-raid best-in-slot rings available outside of <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6622/throne-of-thunder">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Throne of Thunder</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="nalak">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_holy_lightsgrace.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Nalak</span></h3>
<a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69099/nalak">Nalak</a> is another new world boss that has a loot table similar to Sha of Anger and drops Tier 15 legs &amp; gloves at the item level 522, which is the same item level acquired in Normal difficulty raids. If you get lucky and pick up one of these T15 items early in Phase 3, you'll be off to a fantastic start. <br/>
<br/>If you are looking to PvP, you can also obtain various 496 ilvl Season 13 PvP offpieces from this boss. These are also fantastic pre-raid PvE items due to the high item level, if you're lucky enough to get one.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon-warbands">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon and Salyis' Warband</span></h3>
<a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">Galleon &amp; Salyis' Warband</a> drops a number of notable Bind-on-Pickup 496 ilvl epic offpieces:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90438/signet-of-the-bandit-lord">
<img alt="Signet of the Bandit Lord" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicring_b2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Bandit Lord</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90456/cord-of-crazed-strength">
<img alt="Cord of Crazed Strength" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of Crazed Strength</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90433/mushan-riders-collar">
<img alt="Mushan Rider's Collar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_100.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mushan Rider's Collar</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90425/carapace-of-crushed-conviction">
<img alt="Carapace of Crushed Conviction" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Carapace of Crushed Conviction</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90414/greathelm-of-the-monstrous-mushan">
<img alt="Greathelm of the Monstrous Mushan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greathelm of the Monstrous Mushan</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90447/stompers-of-vigorous-stomping">
<img alt="Stompers of Vigorous Stomping" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stompers of Vigorous Stomping</span></a></div></li></ul>One of the most useful items here is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90438/signet-of-the-bandit-lord">
<img alt="Signet of the Bandit Lord" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicring_b2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Bandit Lord</span></a>, which is still a strong ring all the way in Phase 3.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a> is a very notable World Boss because it drops Tier 14 legs &amp; gloves with an item level of 496, which is the same item level acquired from Normal difficulty raids. If you are looking to PvP, you can also obtain various 483 ilvl Malevolent Gladiator's set pieces and offpieces from this boss, though they are slightly outdated now.<br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be handed in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90912/angerforged-stompers">
<img alt="Angerforged Stompers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Angerforged Stompers</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="rare-mobs">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Rare Mobs</span></h3>There are also Rare mobs (aka "silver elites") sprinkled around the Pandaria open world, with their own unique drops. Now, the majority of these unique drops are either toys, cosmetics, or similar items, but a small handful can drop useful Epic items for PvE content.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50350/morgrinn-crackfang">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Morgrinn Crackfang</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87643/fangcracker-battlemace">
<img alt="Fangcracker Battlemace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_2h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fangcracker Battlemace</span></a> - iLvl-420 weapon</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50352/qunas">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Qu'nas</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90717/qunas-apocryphal-legplates">
<img alt="Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates</span></a> - iLvl-440 leggings</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50355/kahtir">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kah'tir</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87218/big-bag-of-arms">
<img alt="Big Bag of Arms" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Big Bag of Arms</span></a> - can contain <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90717/qunas-apocryphal-legplates">
<img alt="Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87643/fangcracker-battlemace">
<img alt="Fangcracker Battlemace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_2h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fangcracker Battlemace</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50344/norlaxx">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Norlaxx</span></a> drops <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87220/big-bag-of-mysteries">
<img alt="Big Bag of Mysteries" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_enchantedmageweave.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Big Bag of Mysteries</span></a> - can contain <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90717/qunas-apocryphal-legplates">
<img alt="Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87643/fangcracker-battlemace">
<img alt="Fangcracker Battlemace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_2h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fangcracker Battlemace</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=51059/blackhoof">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blackhoof</span></a> drops <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86565/battle-horn">
<img alt="Battle Horn" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_horn_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Battle Horn</span></a>, an incredibly useful pulling tool for Challenge Modes</div></li></ul>There is not much else in the way of PvE items to be obtained from these Rare mobs, other than low-level <span class="q3">Rare</span> items that are outclassed before you even reach level 90. In future phases, there will be new Rare Mobs with new rare drops.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="random-world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_coin_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Random World Drops</span></h3>These are bind-on-equip <span class="q4">Epic</span> items that have a very low chance to drop from mobs all over the open world. Most people will only ever obtain items like these by purchasing them on the Auction House, and they will be incredibly expensive, particularly early in the expansion, where the item level of these random BoE drops is relatively high at 476. Therefore, it would be wise to keep your eyes peeled for them if you have lots of extra cash to burn, but most players will not be lucky or wealthy enough to obtain these before picking up something better in raids or Celestial dungeons.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90582/buc-zakai-memento">
<img alt="Buc-Zakai Memento" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_109.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Buc-Zakai Memento</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90580/cristofs-crushing-cloak">
<img alt="Cristof's Crushing Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cristof's Crushing Cloak</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90579/legplates-of-durable-dreams">
<img alt="Legplates of Durable Dreams" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legplates of Durable Dreams</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90581/jan-hos-unwavering-seal">
<img alt="Jan-Ho's Unwavering Seal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicring_b1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jan-Ho's Unwavering Seal</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reputation for Retribution Paladin in Phase 3</span></h2>As an Retribution Paladin, if you are a fresh level 90 and gaining reputation for the first time, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a> above all else, followed by <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1387/kirin-tor-offensive">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kirin Tor Offensive</span></a> /<wbr/> <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1388/sunreaver-onslaught">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sunreaver Onslaught</span></a> and/<wbr/>or <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1375/dominance-offensive">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dominance Offensive</span></a> /<wbr/> <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1376/operation-shieldwall">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Operation: Shieldwall</span></a>, depending on your faction, before moving onto other reputations. This is because in Phase 3 these reputations provide the most valuable items and the rewards from others are slightly outdated at this point.<br/>
<br/>The reputation faction <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1387/kirin-tor-offensive">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kirin Tor Offensive</span></a> is the <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>Alliance counterpart to the <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'></span>Horde faction <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1388/sunreaver-onslaught">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sunreaver Onslaught</span></a>. Likewise, the faction <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1376/operation-shieldwall">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Operation: Shieldwall</span></a> is the <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>Alliance counterpart to the <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'></span>Horde faction <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1375/dominance-offensive">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dominance Offensive</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>The best of the new <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> purchases coming along with <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6622/throne-of-thunder">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Throne of Thunder</span></a>, which have an item level of 522, require reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shado-pan-assault">
